					"content": "Wow, you beat them all down — you made it look pretty easy, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Anna"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140302,
					"content": "You just went at them head-on... It's nice to be strong, huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Anna"
				},
				{
					"id": 200140303,
					"content": "Still, I've got to admit that they still scare me when they're this close. It's a good thing we've got you around...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200140304
